      "title": "README",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# TouchDesigner-style beat reactor for H3\n\n**Sources -> modulators -> targets**, with H3's own audio as the source and H3's own latent as one of the targets.\n\nNothing here is a track laid alongside the video: pass 1 generates the picture and the score together (H3 packs `[text | cond | audio | video]` into one attended sequence), then everything downstream reacts to that exact audio."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
