      "title": "Beat brain",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## The beat brain (sources -> CHOP math)\n\n`RhythmFeatureExtractor` on **beat_locations** gives discrete downbeats rather than a loudness wobble.\n\n`PeakDetector` isolates the hits, `Smoothing` (exponential, alpha 0.35) gives each one a decay tail so objects *ring out* instead of strobing, and `Scaler` maps it to the working range.\n\n`rms_energy` runs in parallel as a slow macro for the section-level moves. Both `PreviewFeature` nodes plot the curve - check those before committing to a long render."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
