      "title": "Latent reaction",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Latent domain - the beat rebuilds geometry\n\n`FeatureToMask` turns the beat envelope into an animated mask; `H3 Latent Noise Mask` writes it at the latent's **exact** shape and aggregates per latent frame (H3 packs 1,4,4,4,4 source frames per 5 tokens), so a one-frame hit survives instead of being interpolated away.\n\n`audio_mode: preserve` carries the score through untouched.\n\nThis is the part a filter stack cannot do: on the hit the **model** re-generates, so objects and materials actually change."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
