      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Material layer",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Image domain - the material layer\n\nRyan's Flex targets bind a feature to **one named parameter** - that is TouchDesigner parameter-binding.\n\n- **Bloom** <- beat drives `intensity` (light swells on the hit)\n- **Chromatic aberration** <- beat drives `shift_amount` (RGB split)\n- **Kaleidoscope** <- energy drives `rotation` (slow section-level turn)\n- **Glitch** <- beat drives `intensity`, gated at 0.55 so only the hardest hits corrupt\n\n`feature_mode: relative` modulates around the base value; `strength` scales how far. Reorder freely - it is a stack."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
